  message: "P0/P1 SWEEP 2026-08-17, dev 11a240f83d. Every claim below was re-derived against the current tree, not re-read off this thread.\n\nSPOT-CHECKED DURING THE P0/P1 SWEEP; NOTHING TO CORRECT. Recording it so a reader knows this thread was audited and not skipped. Two of this item's cells were re-derived independently at dev 11a240f83d: kotlin and javascript still emit NO EDGE on the instance-method form (WI-nasuf's cell, unchanged), and python's attribute chain emits with module slot 'external' -- the L3 shape this item predicted and which the item's own table already records.\n\nThe L2-is-over / L3-is-binding reading holds. INV-mumov has now been retitled to name its L3 gap, which is the reshape this item's 08-17 entry said its headline needed."  # 7570
