  message: "BAND STOP-ORDER OFF, by the band's own terms. The standing rule is '<=25% useful => recall work stays stopped'. Measurement 0012 reads 30.9% pooled / 28.0% unweighted per-repo mean (docs/measurements/0012-taint-precision-after-escape-closure.md). The condition is not met, so the stop-order does not apply. This is not a status change on this item -- nothing on the tracker ever gated it; it blocks six others. It is a decision about effort: receiver-typing work is no longer withheld under the band. Recorded here so the next reader does not re-ask."  # 5542
