  message: "ADR-0051 annotation (WI-virav; annotate only -- no fold, no closure, no re-prioritisation). CLAUSE VIOLATED: \"not a marker for the absence of an answer\". NOTION THE SLOT CARRIES: sentinel (`external`, section uncertainty) at every L3/L4 failure, where the axiom requires the owner path -- for a method-kind primitive, the TYPE. This class item is the axiom read from the consumer side: a catalogue row is addressed by owner path, so a call site whose slot is a sentinel cannot reach its row whatever the receiver syntax was. Each member names where the owner path was lost (emission, binding, chain)."  # 807a
- op: discuss  # b0dd
