  nonce: 35dd  # 35dd
  message: "PHASE 6 SLICE CHOSEN 2026-09-06 on INV-mumov's derivability census (linub_derivability_09062026/): the python L3 payoff is not in project-def return types (58 derivable sites on pretix) but in the Django QuerySet CHAIN -- 1,625 sentinel method edges, 976 on distinctive catalogued names the F3 gate refuses today. First recall PR = QuerySet chain propagation extending WI-sozoj (result of <Model>.objects.<qs>() carries django.db.models; chained QS methods; an untyped-root rule gated on distinctive names, measured separately). Measured by the 0003 delta on pretix with kserve as the zero-move control, every added flow adjudicated, awaits_bakeoff_validation; INV-karud's pretix repro rides the subject run. Second candidate: the reverse-relation manager (1,901 sites; needs a project-wide ForeignKey related_name index)."  # 35dd
- op: discuss  # 750e
