  message: "PHASE 6 PR 1 SHIPPED 2026-09-07 (INV-mumov: QuerySet chain propagation), measured by docs/measurements/0013: on pretix +40 situations / 0 lost / kserve control 0 moved; 87.5% correct, 17.5% useful, the gap being 28 situations on a lazy QuerySet combinator source -- ADR-0049's deferred row, which the same change makes removable under ruling 3 (filed as WI-fasap-zizoh-marov-lihob-jahuf-rosiv-tupuz-dusog, next in Phase 6). The class rule held: measured through the taint path, every added situation read at source."  # 750e
- op: discuss  # 3552
